@IsTest

static void testSharingRuleApplied() {

User targetUser = [SELECT Id FROM User WHERE Username = 'testuser@example.com'];

Account acc = new Account(Name = 'Test', BillingState = 'CA');

insert acc;

Test.startTest();

System.runAs(targetUser) {

List<Account> visible = [SELECT Id FROM Account WHERE Id = :acc.Id];

System.assertEquals(1, visible.size(), 'User should see the Account');

}

Test.stopTest();

}

```

`System.runAs()` enforces the user's sharing context for SOQL inside the block. Use this pattern to assert whether a user can or cannot see specific records.
